:"2026-11-05T23:18:39.954162+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-hl.1","local_name":"bob-cli-hl.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-hl","agent_clan_generation":"20261105180723","bead_id":"bob-cli-hl.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-hl[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capture `<`: merge existing tasks into the task you are creating[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A capture line that creates one open task can end with `< @route+id[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]…` to fold one or more existing tasks into that new task through [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the explicit merge engine, in one all-or-nothing capture whose [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]vault bytes equal today's two-item `>` draft. Misuse teaches the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]right spelling with one-key rewrites, and Bob Mac Capture previews [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the merge as a calm, concise purple band inside the ordinary [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]new-task card.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_merge_in_arrow.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/capture_merge_in_arrow.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-hl[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-hl/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contract and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the `<` contract into docs/capture.md, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-syntax reference, task-merge.md, and task-relations.md, with MI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors and search-smoke rows, marked contract-only.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Grammar, editor parse, and teaching refusals[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the shared merge-in scanner, claim it in execution and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor parsing before fan-out, gate it on a single open new task, ship [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]structured rewrites and grammar 15, and refuse execution until the next [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]phase lands.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One-transaction execution, output, and copy fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: stage the new task, then run one explicit merge into it through[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a helper lifted from the `>` path; report merges, offers, origins, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending context; fix bob-cli-hi merge copy; add the shell guard.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pickers, rewrite toggle, and Similar tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]assist[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]assist: give `<` source slots a merge-only picker with ID-less rows and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]comma multi-pick, the `+` separator toggle, and capture-related source [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exclusion with a marker anchor before the arrow.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture merge-in band and pickers[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute, assist[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: render the Merging-in band inside the new-task card, pending and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refusal states with rewrite buttons, merge-in pickers, folded landing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]groups, submit/status/notification/VoiceOver copy, and raise the grammar[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Memory notes[/bold #D7AFFF]                                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]memory[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory: apply the accepted memory decisions for the Task Merge glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand and the optional new decision record.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-hl","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-hl.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-56f0b6373e882ef65957266e2e8a75f4","started_at":"2026-11-05T23:08:42.050466+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"57eb8617b30b3b7a0014d54312cddf405a518e7494b7f48b49fdeab01c20d06d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-hl.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"78836e0ec32f5230546a14936c23390aea6d78adf9c9310955461fdd09a8579c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-hl.2/meta.json","size_bytes":689},"prompt":{"digest":"251fa53bc330fe189a73e75ce429acf0b1973a1b74e80638283332de1cc8d8fc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-hl.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":181},"state":{"digest":"1b0998b68df83c0f7cac049e0328f1bf0e1451996a9f7ba17502960acfbb195a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-hl.2/sta